    "description": "Central Bank\u2019s \u2018Devil\u2019s Alternative\u2019 to inflation targeting",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Central-Bank-s-Devil-s-Alternative-to-inflation-targeting/4-789001",
