    "description": "\u2018Edges of Sri Lanka\u2019 to showcase country\u2019s unique exports value proposition",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Edges-of-Sri-Lanka-to-showcase-country-s-unique-exports-value-proposition/34-789084",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
