    "description": "The battle for critical minerals: Breaking China\u2019s rare earth grip",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-battle-for-critical-minerals-Breaking-China-s-rare-earth-grip/4-789172",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
