    "chunk_text": "Global Consumer Products earns ISO 9001:2015 certification\n\nReinforcing its position as one of the leading hygienic disposable manufacturers in Sri Lanka and reaffirming its commitment to quality, Global Consumer Products (Pvt) Ltd. (GCP) has received the ISO 9001:2015 certification from the Sri Lanka Standards Institution (SLSI).\n\nGlobal Consumer Products (Pvt) Ltd. holds the unique distinction of being the only manufacturer in Sri Lanka producing soft tissues, oxo-biodegradable, LDPE and HDPE garbage bags, and food care products certified by Sri Lanka Standards Institution (ISO 9001:2015 QMS Certified by SLSI). The company has set the gold standard in the industry, backed by a remarkable legacy spanning over four decades of excellence and compliance.\n\nNDB Bank partners with Cinnamon Lakeside Colombo as Exclusive Banking Partner\n\nSirus Migration brings Duckworth-Lewis-Stern Custodian Prof. Steven Stern to Sri Lanka\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
