    "description": "How US sinking of Iranian warship blew hole in Modi\u2019s \u2018guardian\u2019 claims",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/How-US-sinking-of-Iranian-warship-blew-hole-in-Modi-s-guardian-claims/14-789224",
    "lang": "en",
