    "chunk_text": "FINEZ interior design brand partners Royal \u2013 Thomian cricket encounter for third consecutive year\n\nFINEZ \u2013 Sri Lanka\u2019s leading interior designer brand has partnered with the historic Royal \u2013 Thomian Cricket Encounter as the \u201cOfficial Furniture and Interior Design Partner\u201d for the third consecutive year. The partnership was formally announced at the official press conference for the 147th edition of the iconic encounter, reaffirming FINEZ\u2019s commitment to supporting one of the most celebrated traditions in Sri Lankan school sports. Dhanushka Fernando, Founder and CEO of FINEZ, said: \u201cAs an Old Thomian, the Royal Thomian is more than just a cricket match to me. It represents tradition, brotherhood, and a legacy that has been passed down through generations. Supporting this historic encounter through FINEZ is both a personal honour and a meaningful way for us as a company to give back to the institution that helped shape who I am today. We look forward to continuing our support for this remarkable event.\u201d\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
