    "chunk_text": "Berendina secures dual recognition at CA Sri Lanka TAGS Awards 2025\n\nBerendina Micro Investments Company Limited (BMIC) and Berendina Development Services (Guarantee) Limited (BDS) have both received Bronze Awards at the CA Sri Lanka TAGS Awards 2025. BMIC, the nation\u2019s first licensed microfinance company, was honored for financial reporting excellence, while BDS was recognized in the Not-for-Profit category for transparent reporting and community development. BMIC serves over 100,000 customers with a LKR 6.8 billion loan portfolio, and BDS supports 25,000 families annually.\n\nChairman Anura Atapattu stated the awards validate that transparency is core to the organization\u2019s mission, demonstrating that every rupee is accounted for.\n\nComBank and David Pieris Automobiles join forces for attractive leasing packages\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
