    "description": "The hidden cost of substandard coal: Estimating the national impact on Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-hidden-cost-of-substandard-coal-Estimating-the-national-impact-on-Sri-Lanka/4-789262",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
