    "chunk_text": "Sir Mark Tucker calls on Foreign Minister\n\nFormer HSBC Holdings Group Chairman and currently AIA Group Independent Non-Executive Chairman and Non-Executive Director Sir Mark Tucker called on Foreign Affairs, Tourism and Foreign Employment Minister Vijitha Herath yesterday during his visit to the country from 9\u201310 March.\n\nTucker briefed the Minister on the progress of their operations in Sri Lanka. The Minister invited AIA Group to further expand the company\u2019s footprint in the country."
