    "chunk_text": "DIMO, the only Authorised agent for Mercedes-Benz in Sri Lanka, plays a pivotal role in connecting the local platform to the wider Mercedes-Benz Fashion Week ecosystem worldwide. The deepening collaboration between AOD and DIMO signals a shared long-term commitment to elevating Sri Lanka\u2019s fashion industry onto the regional and global stage.\n\nUnder the three-year roadmap, the Mercedes-Benz platform in Sri Lanka will continue to expand its integration across fashion, design, mobility, and future lifestyle conversations.\n\nThe initiative builds on the global Mercedes-Benz Fashion Week philosophy of intelligent luxury and innovation, positioning Sri Lanka as an increasingly important node within the wider network.\n\nCinnamon Life at City of Dreams as the Official Host Venue, places MBFW Sri Lanka at the centre of Colombo\u2019s most significant integrated lifestyle development.\n\nThe collaboration reflects strong alignment between MBFW Sri Lanka\u2019s global ambitions and Cinnamon Life\u2019s positioning as a premier destination for culture, entertainment, and luxury experiences. Both organisations will work closely to deliver an elevated October 2026 edition while continuing to explore future opportunities as the platform scales regionally."
