    "description": "US-Israeli strikes targeted at least 6,668 civilian units: Red Crescent",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/US-Israeli-strikes-targeted-at-least-6-668-civilian-units-Red-Crescent/56-789332",
