    "chunk_size_bytes": 536,
    "chunk_text": "Trump calls choice of Iran\u2019s new supreme leader \u2018a big mistake\u2019\n\nThe US president Donald Trump yesterday said Iran has \u201cmade a big mistake\u201d by choosing Mojtaba Khamenei as the new supreme leader after his father was killed in the US-Israel attack.\n\n\u201cI think they made a big mistake\u201d in selecting Mojtaba Khameini, Trump told NBC News.\n\nHe earlier described Ayatollah Ali Khamenei\u2019s son as a \u201clight weight\u201d.\n\nTrump also said it\u2019s \u201ctoo soon to talk about\u201d seizing Iran\u2019s oil but he \u201cdoesn\u2019t rule it out\u201d."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2026-03-10-dailyftlk-a1b45328",
    "num": "dailyftlk-a1b45328",
    "date_str": "2026-03-10",
    "description": "Iran names Mojtaba Khamenei as new supreme leader after father\u2019s killing",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Iran-names-Mojtaba-Khamenei-as-new-supreme-leader-after-father-s-killing/56-789334",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1773103726.0,
