    "description": "The evidentiary lock-out: A global outlier and a death knell for Sri Lankan tax justice",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-evidentiary-lock-out-A-global-outlier-and-a-death-knell-for-Sri-Lankan-tax-justice/4-789346",
