    "description": "Humanity before geopolitics: Sri Lanka\u2019s rescue decision and spirit of non-alignment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Humanity-before-geopolitics-Sri-Lanka-s-rescue-decision-and-spirit-of-non-alignment/4-789347",
