    "chunk_size_bytes": 795,
    "chunk_text": "The expansion of Aliya Beer into international markets represents a major milestone for DCSL Breweries Lanka. With a strategic focus on global growth, the company is aiming to raise Aliya Beer\u2019s profile in key international markets, building strong brand awareness and cultivating a loyal consumer base. This move highlights not only the superior quality of Aliya Beer but also the pride and heritage of Sri Lanka.\n\nDCSL Breweries Lanka\u2019s portfolio already includes prominent international brands like Heineken and Tiger, as well as well-established local names such as Bison and DCSL Beer. The inclusion of Aliya Beer further strengthens the company\u2019s dedication to brewing excellence, ensuring a robust and diverse selection of both internationally recognised and locally crafted brands."
