    "description": "From sandcastles to survival: Sri Lanka in the age of Trump waves",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-sandcastles-to-survival-Sri-Lanka-in-the-age-of-Trump-waves/4-789403",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
