    "description": "Opposition & Opponents: The Erosion Of Parliamentary Tradition In Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/opposition-opponents-the-erosion-of-parliamentary-tradition-in-sri-lanka/",
