    "description": "CID tells Court  that Ex-Intelligence Chief Maj-Gen Suresh Salley  is  Detained Under the PTA  over three Allegations Relating to the Easter Bombings Investigation;Case Fixed for Hearing on March 25th",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87317",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1773240240.0,
