    "description": "Public Institutions Or Executive Privilege? Questions Around State Bank Governance",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/public-institutions-or-executive-privilege-questions-around-state-bank-governance/",
    "lang": "en",
