    "chunk_size_bytes": 1238,
    "chunk_text": "Visa serves up global culinary stardom as Official Payment Partner\n\nVisa, a global leader in digital payments, today announced its association as the Official Payment Partner for the inaugural season of MasterChef Sri Lanka, bringing one of the world\u2019s most celebrated culinary television formats to Sri Lankan audiences for the very first time.\n\nRecognised by Guinness World Records as the world\u2019s most successful cookery television format, MasterChef has expanded to over 70 international adaptations, airing in more than 200 territories and broadcasting over 10,000 episodes globally. Its arrival in Sri Lanka marks a defining milestone, placing the nation\u2019s rich culinary heritage and emerging talent on a globally recognised stage.\n\nDining remains a core passion for Visa in Sri Lanka, reflected in its ongoing efforts to enhance how consumers discover, enjoy, and pay for food through curated experiences and exclusive privileges. The partnership with MasterChef Sri Lanka builds on this commitment by blending global entertainment with local culinary talent \u2013 celebrating Sri Lanka\u2019s rich food culture while empowering communities, supporting tourism and small businesses, and expanding access through digital innovation."
