    "chunk_text": "Ruwan Rajapakse named new MD/Executive Director of Hayleys Fibre\n\nHayleys Fibre PLC has appointed Ruwan Rajapakse as Managing Director and Executive Director of the company.\n\nRajapakse possesses over 30 years of professional experience with more than 20 years of international exposure, serving in senior leadership positions across global manufacturing, supply chain management, agriculture, and international trade.\n\nHe previously served as Global Chief Production Officer of the Jiffy Group and as a Member of the Group\u2019s top management, headquartered in Rotterdam, Netherlands, where he led the company\u2019s global production, operations, and supply chain across multiple facilities in Europe, North America, and Asia. Prior to this, he served as Director/CEO of Hayleys Agri Horticulture Sector and has also held senior leadership roles at Hayleys Advantis and Maersk Line, focusing on global trade strategy, logistics, and international market development.\n\nRajapakse holds an MBA from the University of Colombo, a BSc from the University of Kelaniya, and is a Certified Management Accountant (CMA \u2013 Australia). He is also Lean Six Sigma Black Belt qualified in Manufacturing. He actively contributes to several national and international business and export-related"
