    "chunk_size_bytes": 1377,
    "chunk_text": "Founded in 2016, Link4 has expanded from Australia into multiple Asia-Pacific jurisdictions and now supports thousands of organisations across the region. The company focuses exclusively on compliant, scalable e-Invoicing solutions integrated with leading ERP systems.\n\nThe acquisition strengthens Link4\u2019s: Singapore market position; Recurring revenue base; Regional customer footprint and Long-term mandate-driven growth strategy.\n\nWith e-Invoicing mandates expanding across Asia-Pacific, Link4 remains focused on sustainable ARR growth, regional scale, and delivering compliant e-Invoicing and compliance solutions that enable businesses to transact seamlessly across borders.\n\nLink4 is a leading e-Invoicing network provider delivering secure, compliant digital invoicing solutions across the Asia-Pacific region. Founded in Australia in 2016, Link4 enables businesses, accounting firms and software providers to exchange invoices seamlessly through government-mandated e-Invoicing frameworks such as Peppol. The Link4 platform integrates with major ERP and accounting systems, helping organisations automate accounts payable and receivable processes, improve cash flow visibility and meet regulatory compliance requirements. With a rapidly expanding customer base across multiple markets, Link4 continues to support businesses transitioning to the global digital economy."
