    "chunk_text": "HNB Finance clinches Silver at the Diamond Jubilee TAGS Awards 2025\n\nThe TAGS Awards Committee of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Sri Lanka (CA Sri Lanka) announced HNB Finance PLC as the Silver Award winner in the Finance Companies and Leasing Companies sector (Total Group Assets LKR 25\u201375 billion) at the Diamond Jubilee celebration of the prestigious TAGS Awards 2025. The ceremony, held at the Shangri-La Hotel Colombo on 12th February, marked the Company\u2019s fourth consecutive win at the awards.\n\nHNB Finance advanced from last year\u2019s Bronze to Silver, reflecting its continued commitment to excellence in transparency, accountability, governance, and sustainability. In addition to securing the Silver Award, the company received Certificates of Recognition in the Corporate Governance Disclosure \u2013 Financial Services special award category and the Integrated Reporting special award category at the TAGS Awards 2025.\n\nSt. Anthony\u2019s Service launches new digital platforms to strengthen customer convenience and service excellence\n\nVision to Reality: A year of learning, leadership and global engagement for COYLE\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
