    "chunk_text": "St. Anthony\u2019s Service launches new digital platforms to strengthen customer convenience and service excellence\n\nSt. Anthony\u2019s Service, a subsidiary of St. Anthony\u2019s Hardware (Pvt) Ltd, has officially launched its dedicated website and social media platforms, marking a significant milestone in the company\u2019s ongoing digital transformation journey. The website, www.stanthonysservice.lk, was ceremonially launched by Sarath Ganamage, Director / General Manager of St. Anthony\u2019s Hardware (Pvt) Ltd, together with r Rumesh Jayasekara, Senior Marketing Manager, and Sujeewa Herath, Senior Service Manager, reaffirming the Group\u2019s commitment to innovation, accessibility, and customer-centric service delivery.\n\nThe website serves as a comprehensive and centralised digital hub, enabling contractors, builders, and homeowners to conveniently explore a wide range of service solutions under one platform. With clearly structured and dedicated pages for each service category, users can seamlessly navigate through hardware-related services, solar hot water and PV system solutions, machinery repairs, water purification services, CCTV solutions, and home appliance maintenance.\n\nGeorge Steuart partners with the Sri Lanka Natural History Society to promote Sri Lanka\u2019s ecological legacy\n\nHNB Finance clinches Silver at the Diamond Jubilee TAGS Awards 2025\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
