    "description": "Nearly 300 children killed since start of Iran conflict: UNICEF",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Nearly-300-children-killed-since-start-of-Iran-conflict-UNICEF/56-789488",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
