    "chunk_size_bytes": 1731,
    "chunk_text": "Janashakthi Finance wins Bronze Effie Award for  \u2018uplifting Sri Lankan three-wheel community\u2019 campaign\n\nJanashakthi Finance PLC, a subsidiary of JXG (Janashakthi Group), has been awarded the Bronze Effie at the Effie Awards Sri Lanka 2025 in the Finance category for its impactful campaign, \u201cuplifting the Sri Lankan three-wheel community.\u201d\n\nThe recognition highlights the company\u2019s ability to combine creative storytelling with measurable business results, while advancing financial inclusion and livelihood empowerment for underserved communities.\n\nOrganised by the Sri Lanka Institute of Marketing (SLIM), the Effie Awards are widely regarded as one of the most prestigious honours in the marketing and advertising industry, recognising marketing communications that demonstrate proven effectiveness, strong strategic thinking, and tangible impact.\n\nThe award-winning campaign was inspired by the resilience and dedication of Sri Lanka\u2019s three-wheel drivers, an essential yet often underserved segment within the country\u2019s transport ecosystem. Many within this community rely on three-wheel vehicles as their primary source of income, supporting families and contributing significantly to the country\u2019s informal economy.\n\nThrough a combination of digital, traditional and on-ground engagement initiatives, Janashakthi Finance connected directly with the three-wheel community, recognising their contribution to society while providing accessible financial solutions designed to support income generation and long-term livelihood stability. The campaign focused on empowering drivers with opportunities to access responsible financing, helping them maintain or upgrade their vehicles and sustain their businesses."
  },
