    "chunk_text": "Through a combination of digital, traditional and on-ground engagement initiatives, Janashakthi Finance connected directly with the three-wheel community, recognising their contribution to society while providing accessible financial solutions designed to support income generation and long-term livelihood stability. The campaign focused on empowering drivers with opportunities to access responsible financing, helping them maintain or upgrade their vehicles and sustain their businesses.\n\nBy highlighting the aspirations, challenges and contributions of three-wheel drivers, the campaign positioned Janashakthi Finance as more than a financial services provider, establishing the brand as a trusted partner that understands and supports everyday livelihoods.\n\nThe recognition further strengthens Janashakthi Finance PLC\u2019s reputation for marketing excellence and purpose-driven engagement, while reinforcing its commitment to inclusive finance and sustainable economic empowerment across Sri Lanka."
