    "chunk_size_bytes": 1791,
    "chunk_text": "SLT-MOBITEL unveils redesigned fibre broadband packages  powering homes and businesses\n\nFastest, most stable and seamlessly unlimited fibre connectivity for a digitally driven Sri Lanka\n\nSLT-MOBITEL has unveiled a redesigned portfolio of \u2018fibre unlimited broadband packages\u2019, empowering customers to step confidently into a digitally connected future driven by speed, stability, and unlimited possibilities.\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s National ICT Solutions Provider introduces a revitalised range of \u2018unlimited\u2019 packages, crafted to meet the evolving digital lifestyles of households and the growing connectivity demands of businesses. Built on world-class fibre infrastructure, the new offerings deliver ultra-fast speeds, low latency, unmatched stability, and uninterrupted unlimited access, positioning SLT-MOBITEL fibre as the nation\u2019s most powerful fixed broadband unlimited plans beginning from Rs. 5,900 plus taxes.\n\nDesigned for a world where digital experiences define progress, the redesigned \u2018fibre portfolio\u2019 offers blazing speeds ranging from 100 Mbps up to 1000 Mbps, enabling seamless streaming, gaming, remote work, online learning, and enterprise operations with absolute reliability.\n\nThe \u2018unlimited fibre\u2019 packages are tailored to diverse user needs and budgets, starting from Home at Rs. 5,900 per month for small families, Home Plus at Rs. 9,900, Twin at Rs. 14,900 for streamers and start-ups, Pro at Rs. 19,900 for gamers and large households, Edge at Rs. 29,900 for tech-savvy families and small businesses, and Turbo at Rs. 39,900 for power users, professional gamers, and enterprises. In addition, an entry-level option, the Anytime Plan Fibre Starter, is available from just Rs. 2,690 per month for 80 GB, ensuring accessible connectivity for every segment."
