    "chunk_text": "Profood Propack connects distributors, manufacturers, suppliers, and industry professionals, showcasing the latest advancements in food and beverage production, processing, packaging machinery, and hospitality sector. The exhibition also highlights operational efficiency, smart manufacturing, and sustainable practices to meet the evolving needs of the modern food industry.\n\nThe event offers strong B2B networking, enabling partnerships, trade agreements, and market expansion. It provides a platform for startups, SMEs, and established brands to grow, while international exhibitors bring global expertise and innovation, strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s position as a regional food and packaging hub.\n\nKnowledge sharing remains a central focus this year. The expanded Knowledge Hub, alongside live demonstrations and expert-led sessions, supports skill development and industry insight, while a dedicated Consumer Assistance Desk guides emerging entrepreneurs in exploring opportunities and navigating the business landscape effectively.\n\nProfood Propack also holds significant economic and national relevance, contributing to the growth of Sri Lanka\u2019s food, beverage, packaging, and agriculture industries while supporting export development, tourism, and employment generation. It aligns closely with national objectives for industrial development and value addition.\n\nBringing together trade, innovation, and expertise, Profood Propack & Agbiz Knowledge Hub 2026 will strengthen Sri Lanka\u2019s role as a regional hub for the food, beverage, and packaging sectors. Join industry leaders, innovators, entrepreneurs, and stakeholders to position the business at the forefront of the island\u2019s dynamic food and packaging landscape."
