    "chunk_text": "Fairness under the law: Any legal proceedings against him must be free from political vendetta, conducted transparently, and uphold his right to a fair legal process.\n\nProtection of professional freedom: The Government must practically honour its pledges to ensure the professional safety of journalists and safeguard freedom of expression."
