    "chunk_size_bytes": 1220,
    "chunk_text": "Fcode Labs launches Forevate to speed up business decisions\n\nFcode Labs has launched Forevate, a real-time market intelligence platform designed to help businesses respond faster to market changes.\n\nThe new solution combines internal company data with external intelligence to track competitor activity, pricing movements, and social trends as they happen. It targets industries where rapid change often outpaces traditional planning, including manufacturing, retail, supply chain, and FMCG.\n\nCo-CEO Buddhishan Manamperi said businesses can no longer rely on outdated planning cycles. \u201cChanges in competitor activity, pricing, and social trends can happen overnight,\u201d he said.\n\nUnlike static analytics tools, Forevate uses a two-phase model: a Design Pod to map where intelligence can have the greatest impact, followed by a Delivery Pod to test and refine insights continuously.\n\nHP Outlines Five-Pillar Strategy to Enable Digital Inclusion in Sri Lanka\n\nIRCSL marks 25 years of transforming Sri Lanka\u2019s insurance sector\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
