    "doc_id": "2026-03-16-dailyftlk-d0686c86",
    "num": "dailyftlk-d0686c86",
    "date_str": "2026-03-16",
    "description": "Rethinking the proposed amendment to Thin Capitalisation rule and the fate of SMEs",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Rethinking-the-proposed-amendment-to-Thin-Capitalisation-rule-and-the-fate-of-SMEs/4-789589",
