    "description": "Iran allows several Indian vessels safe passage through Strait of Hormuz: Envoy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Iran-allows-several-Indian-vessels-safe-passage-through-Strait-of-Hormuz-Envoy/56-789616",
    "lang": "en",
