    "description": "US might continue to bomb Iran\u2019s Kharg Island \u201cjust for fun,\u201d says Trump",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/US-might-continue-to-bomb-Iran-s-Kharg-Island-just-for-fun-says-Trump/56-789617",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1773617049.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-03-16-dailyftlk-68694b12-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
