    "description": "BASL\u2019s National Labour Law Symposium to convene legal, regulatory and industry leaders",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/BASL-s-National-Labour-Law-Symposium-to-convene-legal-regulatory-and-industry-leaders/34-789622",
    "lang": "en",
