    "date_str": "2026-03-17",
    "description": "Are we failing our youth? The reality behind  Sri Lankan\u2019s job crisis",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Are-we-failing-our-youth-The-reality-behind-Sri-Lankan-s-job-crisis/4-789648",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
