    "description": "SL calls for immediate de-escalation  of tensions in Middle East, global peace",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/SL-calls-for-immediate-de-escalation-of-tensions-in-Middle-East-global-peace/56-789668",
    "lang": "en",
