    "description": "Opening the lid on the genie:  Telltale evidence and terrorism laws",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Opening-the-lid-on-the-genie-Telltale-evidence-and-terrorism-laws/4-789709",
    "lang": "en",
