    "chunk_text": "ME war to push 45 m people into acute hunger by June: WFP\n\nAn additional 45 million people are projected to face acute hunger if the US-Israeli war on Iran continues until June, the World Food Program has said in its latest analysis.\n\nTens of millions are expected to be pushed into acute hunger as a result of rises in food, oil and shipping costs, the organisation\u2019s deputy executive director Carl Skau told reporters \u200cin \u200cGeneva.\n\nThat would push the global tally for acute hunger above its current record level of 319 million, he said."
